{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And you shall present them in the basket</b> — this continues from what precedes it: it says that the bread in the basket, and the bull, and the rams, and Aaron and his sons — they shall present to the entrance of the Tent of Meeting, and you shall wash them with water — for Aaron and his sons. But it is more correct that <b>and you shall present them in the basket</b> should not be specified [as a distinct matter], for from the unelaborated statement it is known that he is to bring them to the place where he commands the priests to come, and the second verse speaks concerning Aaron and his sons, and therefore it says, and you shall wash them with water."], :book :exodus, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T04:18:51.938705825Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}